        "filing_date": "2026-06-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, in numerous locations we support projects designed to impact our employees and their families such as establishing health clinics and wellness programs to assist our employees, administering after school care for schoolchildren, or funding local cultural events.",
