        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Sustainability efforts in our supply chain emphasize important issues related to the countries and communities in which we operate and include and focus on the protection of tobacco farm worker rights through appropriate agricultural labor practices and monitoring the reduction of environmental impacts through compliance with industry-recognized GAP programs, as well as our own environmental programs and initiatives.",
